{"id":2215,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>春日融融，惠风和畅。4月24日，中北大学第四十四届大学生春季田径运动会在中区田径场隆重开幕。航空宇航学院的师生们以昂扬的姿态奔赴这场青春盛会。赛场上，运动健儿奋勇争先；赛场下，师生同心聚力。航院运动员们用拼搏与坚守，书写了属于学院的热血篇章，展现了“航宇人”独有的风采与担当。</p><p></p><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VLzf2VnNU4LzrVndRCaLzGaMRlZUNU-ZM7lbMzCsMmQfnRU0gihFp2hmCIa0MSh7U1yPn1yinz7ZUN-bUmUsL4UaMlVVL4VVnz7ao7W2MzrFU8LDnm9bnzQFM77ioRNJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLR7sgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10017&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/5DB1F5E18BB9B473405AE31EE108BF55/CC6F89E6/4A589\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VLzf2VnNU4LzrVndRCaLzGaMRlZUNU-ZM7lbMzCsMmQfnRU0gihFp2hmCIa0MSh7U1yPn1yinz7ZUN-bUmUsL4UaMlVVL4VVnz7ao7W2MzrFU8LDnm9bnzQFM77ioRNJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLR7sgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10017&e=.jpg\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VM4v2sM4TVLRLsLd8M7oz-DnRrkLR7-DoRUPMNL4U4vZnlU0gihFp2hmCIa0LkybMYyDLkhRnNnkU4UaU4M2o77DMz-aLNlYnlCPn7WfUlnFUzMkL4QRMRTFUlCYoz9Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLR7sgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10017&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/09760CFDBC40C3F8A65202E2EF1DBAAD/A3B36C49/AF298\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VLRn2RozU8LR-8odRlanN-PLRlsMmT-2U4CZM7laL4CiUlU0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhRUYyZLkyYLzrVL4ARnRU4M8LDnR-YUllPnmvDnznVolnFMNU4MmARM4VFLz7bU4nfgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRGPMYbw62W8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10017&e=.jpg\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><p>单项田径赛事中，我院多名运动员奋勇拼搏、全力以赴。冉昕晨获女子跳远第一名、女子3000米第六名；包静获女子800米第二名；牛思蕊获女子跳远第五名；黄耿炜获男子200米第六名；马剑涛获男子5000米第七名，全员奋勇争先，在赛道上展现自身实力。</p><p></p><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VMzW2fMmCDL8VkUdmlsU49DU87iM8r-RMmL8UNCaMR9bU870gihFp2hmCIa0U1yiLYhkLky8MlL4L49DUm7YM7