p><p>团体趣味项目里，各组队员同心协力、默契配合。李秉然、韩旭东、裴根、方伟臣荣获男子4×100米接力第八名；杨羽翔、闫婉珧、孙华瑞、王鑫泽、卓有乐、解晓瑜斩获滚轮胎混合接力第五名；裴根、杨嘉欣、杨烁琪、冯靖凯、赵程、马越越、余烨、陈紫添、刘良斌、李昭林取得混合立定跳远团体第六名；谢坤、程歆潆、孙华瑞、黄一安获得混合太行烽火线第八名。一次次交接冲刺、一次次并肩协作，充分彰显航空宇航学子团结一致、凝心聚力的集体风貌，尽显航宇大家庭同心同行的强大凝聚力。<br></p><p></p><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VM7W2fnzMRUNVRndlLbol7iU4r2U4T-2nmn2LmLPMz9iL4L0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yYLky4L1yYU4UDMm9bnllbUmVVLNCsUmnfM4WfoR-bMm6FM7liMz9aL7VFLNlaL8lJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLR7sgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10017&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B20322C46689EE9B1E2F7B4A72A82967/4E55800A/2E03E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VM7W2fnzMRUNVRndlLbol7iU4r2U4T-2nmn2LmLPMz9iL4L0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yYLky4L1yYU4UDMm9bnllbUmVVLNCsUmnfM4WfoR-bMm6FM7liMz9aL7VFLNlaL8lJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLR7sgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10017&e=.jpg\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Vo7M2fMzUPLmW7UdzUaMRGaLzf2Mm9-DM4r2LRC4MlLYUzL0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyYL1yPLSyaL4CsMzvZMm-inNCao7LsozNPL4ffnNQRMmTFLRNaL7MVUlVFMlQko7LJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLR7sgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10017&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/422110367578625FF08C799130AFFC69/0900CEAA/5FB8C\" vheight=\" 261px\" vwidth=\" 357px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Vo7M2fMzUPLmW7UdzUaMRGaLzf2Mm9-DM4r2LRC4MlLYUzL0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyYL1yPLSyaL4CsMzvZMm-inNCao7LsozNPL4ffnNQRMmTFLRNaL7MVUlVFMlQko7LJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLR7sgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10017&e=.jpg\"></div></td></tr><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VL4U24nzVVol78UdzvZozVVM7V7MzV-RLzvZUz94M47DLRG0gihFp2hmCIa0oSy4UYy4n1yYLR62UlCiUzQVU4UboRV7o7U4oRlanzU8UlVFUl7sUmf7L8rFM8l4ozvJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLR7sgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10017&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"